--TEST--
A `private` or `protected` property read or written through an `object` or `mixed` receiver throws, as a call of a method that is not `public` does — `rule:types/erased-member-access`
--FILE--
<?nvs
// An erased receiver is outside every class, so it reaches `public` properties
// only. That holds inside the class too: `same()` reads through `object` and
// is refused, while `balance()` reads through `$this` and is not.
class Account {
    private int $balance = 10;
    protected string $owner = "ann";
    public string $label = "main";

    public function constructor() { }

    public function balance(): int {
        return $this->balance;
    }

    public function same(object $other): mixed {
        return $other->balance;
    }
}

object $o = new Account();
mixed $m = new Account();

try {
    echo $o->balance, "\n";
} catch (Throwable $e) {
    echo $e->message, "\n";
}
try {
    $o->balance = 999;
} catch (Throwable $e) {
    echo $e->message, "\n";
}
try {
    echo $m->owner, "\n";
} catch (Throwable $e) {
    echo $e->message, "\n";
}
try {
    $m->owner = "eve";
} catch (Throwable $e) {
    echo $e->message, "\n";
}
try {
    echo $m->balance ?? "none", "\n";
} catch (Throwable $e) {
    echo $e->message, "\n";
}
try {
    echo (new Account())->same(new Account()), "\n";
} catch (Throwable $e) {
    echo $e->message, "\n";
}

// A `public` property is reached as before, and the refused writes changed nothing.
$o->label = "spare";
echo $o->label, "\n";
echo ($o as Account)->balance(), "\n";
echo $m is {balance: int} ? "matches" : "does not match", "\n";
--EXPECT--
`Account::$balance` is private. Only a public property can be read through `object`, `mixed` or a shape type.
`Account::$balance` is private. Only a public property can be written through `object`, `mixed` or a shape type.
`Account::$owner` is protected. Only a public property can be read through `object`, `mixed` or a shape type.
`Account::$owner` is protected. Only a public property can be written through `object`, `mixed` or a shape type.
`Account::$balance` is private. Only a public property can be read through `object`, `mixed` or a shape type.
`Account::$balance` is private. Only a public property can be read through `object`, `mixed` or a shape type.
spare
10
does not match
